OL,3,AWe'll crumble when inquiry ends, says
OL,4,Avictim's mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrace's mother, Dr Sinead
OL,7,FO'Malley-Kumar, says the end of the
OL,8,Finquiry will mark "just the beginning"
OL,9,Ffor her family to grieve.
